1
00:00:00,769 --> 00:00:03,899
(Bernadette:)How come this one's on
the back of an eviction notice?

2
00:00:03,905 --> 00:00:07,505
(Stuart:)Oh, yeah.
Uh, now that you mention it...

3
00:00:07,509 --> 00:00:09,839
(Stuart:)can I live here?

4
00:00:11,213 --> 00:00:13,683
(Bernadette:)Stuart, we'd love
to help you out,

5
00:00:13,682 --> 00:00:16,712
but this a bad time;
we're about to have a baby.

6
00:00:16,718 --> 00:00:18,448
(Stuart:)Or is that why
this is a great time?

7
00:00:18,453 --> 00:00:20,453
(Sheldon:)Think about it--
when that baby comes,

8
00:00:20,455 --> 00:00:22,685
(Stuart:)you're gonna need all the help
you can get.

9
00:00:22,691 --> 00:00:24,121
(Howard:)Thank you,

10
00:00:24,125 --> 00:00:26,095
(Bernadette:)but I'm not really sure.

11
00:00:27,028 --> 00:00:28,558
(Howard:)Hang on, maybe it's
not the worst idea.

12
00:00:28,563 --> 00:00:31,493
(Howard:)I mean, he did do a good job
taking care of my mother.

13
00:00:31,499 --> 00:00:35,769
(Stuart:)That woman didn't get heat rash
once with me on powder patrol.

14
00:00:37,505 --> 00:00:38,835
(Leonard:)Hey...

15
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,410
(Bernadette:)I guess you could stay
for a few days

16
00:00:40,408 --> 00:00:41,708
(Bernadette:)and we'll see how it goes.

17
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:43,110
(Howard:)Thank you.

18
00:00:43,111 --> 00:00:44,911
(Stuart:)And it's only temporary,

19
00:00:44,913 --> 00:00:47,083
(Stuart:)just till I get back on my feet.

20
00:00:47,082 --> 00:00:49,882
(Stuart:)or the baby goes off to college,
whichever happens first.

21
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:53,450
(Howard:)When would you move in?

22
00:00:53,455 --> 00:00:56,225
(Stuart:)Well, uh, my car broke down
in your driveway,

23
00:00:56,224 --> 00:00:59,024
(Stuart:)so I'm gonna say now.

